<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Hire purchase: finding the flat rate of interest (INNODEMS)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>A {@item@} has a cash price of Ksh \( {@C0@} \). To buy it on hire purchase, a customer pays a deposit of Ksh \( {@D0@} \) and \( {@n0@} \) monthly instalments of Ksh \( {@x0@} \).</p>
<p>(a) How much interest is charged?</p>
<div>Interest \( = \) Ksh [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div>
<p>(b) Find the annual flat rate of interest charged on the balance.</p>
<div>Rate \( = \) [[input:ans2]] \( \% \) per annum [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>(a)</strong> Balance \( = {@C0@} - {@D0@} = {@B0@} \). Instalments total \( {@n0@} \times {@x0@} = {@n0*x0@} \). So the interest is \( {@n0*x0@} - {@B0@} = {@I0@} \).</p>
<p><strong>(b)</strong> The time is \( \frac{ {@n0@} }{12} = {@rd(Y0)@} \) years. From \( I = \dfrac{PRT}{100} \) with \( P = {@B0@} \):</p>
\[ R = \frac{100 \times I}{P \times T} = \frac{100 \times {@I0@}}{ {@B0@} \times {@rd(Y0)@} } = {@rd(R0)@}\% \text{ per annum}. \]]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>2</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.1</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <idnumber/>
    <stackversion>
      <text>2025010100</text>
    </stackversion>
    <questionvariables>
      <text><![CDATA[rd(v) := if integerp(v) then v else float(v);
item : rand(["sofa set", "laptop", "oven", "bicycle", "smartphone", "television"]);
cands : sublist(create_list([u, w, r, v], u, [20000, 40000, 50000, 60000, 90000], w, [10, 20, 25], r, [10, 12, 15, 20, 25], v, [12, 18, 24]),
  lambda([z], block([b], b : z[1]*(1 - z[2]/100), integerp(b*(1 + z[3]*z[4]/1200)/z[4]))));
pk : rand(cands);
C0 : pk[1];
D0 : C0*pk[2]/100;
R0 : pk[3];
n0 : pk[4];
Y0 : n0/12;
B0 : C0 - D0;
I0 : B0*R0*Y0/100;
x0 : (B0 + I0)/n0;
w_ofC  : 100*I0/(C0*Y0);                  /* rate on the full cash price */
w_noT  : 100*I0/B0;                       /* forgot to divide by the time */
w_mon  : 100*I0/(B0*n0);                  /* time in months */]]></text>
    </questionvariables>
